+    \begin{fact}[Standard Generators of the Modular Matrix Group]\label{r4:sl2-generators}
+        The group $\SL_2(\Z)$ of integer $2\times2$ matrices with determinant
+        $1$ is generated by
+        \[
+            \mathbf{S}=\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\1&0\end{pmatrix},
